Mirror Mode and Fast Travel are built as exlaunch modules. exlaunch
(https://github.com/shadowninja108/exlaunch) is licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.0
and is not included here; you obtain it separately when building. A compiled module (subsdk9 or
subsdk5) therefore contains exlaunch code, and that portion of any binary is distributed under
GPL-2.0 terms. This repository provides the source for the mods' own code; exlaunch's source is
available from its upstream repository.

Builds use devkitPro's devkitA64 toolchain.

The patch-file mods (pchtxt) contain only their own instruction words and use no exlaunch code.

No Nintendo game assets or code are included. The offsets and instruction words in the source
identify locations in the game's own executable and are used to verify the supported version.
